      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Marcus and Andre lean heavily into the \"street-savvy youth\" trope, while Julian and Elena embody the archetypal \"powerful elite.\" Hiroshi is a bit more modern but risks being the \"genius hacker\" stereotype in a sci-fi context. Marcus and Andre would suit a gritty crime drama well, whereas Julian and Elena are tailor-made for a high-society drama. To avoid clichés, consider giving these archetypes deeply specific, contradictory flaws.",
      "source": "target",
